\section{Prediction and mapping are separate}{

Predictions are generated by \code{\link[=predict.bm_fit]{predict.bm_fit()}} and can be expensive for a
fine grid. Compute them once, for example
\code{pred <- predict(model, grid, random = c(locality = "marginal"), n_draws = 300)},
